  "_sheet": "Card art motifs. One row = one motif a card can use (cards.json art column). Each motif is a stack of layers drawn in the card's art window (260x150, origin at its centre, y up). Shapes are generated in code (no image files); colours come from the card's theme. Generated/ArtTable.cs gets one ArtMotif per row.",
